TranslationUnitDecl
|-ClassTemplateDecl Buf
| |-NonTypeTemplateParmDecl referenced 'unsigned int' depth 0 index 0 N
| |-CXXRecordDecl struct Buf definition
| | |-FieldDecl bytes 'char[N]'
| | `-FieldDecl words 'int[N / 2 + 1]'
| `-ClassTemplateSpecializationDecl struct Buf definition implicit_instantiation
|   |-TemplateArgument value 'unsigned int' 8
|   |-FieldDecl bytes 'char[8]'
|   `-FieldDecl words 'int[5]'
`-VarDecl sz 'int' cinit
  `-ImplicitCastExpr 'int' <IntegralCast>
    `-UnaryExprOrTypeTraitExpr 'unsigned long' sizeof 'Buf<8>'
